",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_143","No, I've never heard of the God of Grace having any other name.==W== I suppose it's just a unique belief of the North. People here revere more primal, natural entities.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_143","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_143","For example, sailors would tattoo ocean waves onto their bodies, believing this would grant them the sea's power and ensure safe voyages.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So this cave was ... a site for nature worship, or something?",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","013",null,0.42,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["cbg",0,-50.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,-50.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["obj","qstory_event_04_006",1,0.7,0.54],["se","se_062"],["say","avg1_143","I suppose so, but...==W== This mural's content is pretty bizarre.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Looks like they're performing some kind of ... ritual?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.15,"OutCubic",1.5,null,null,null],["se","se_226"],["say","avg1_143","\"God descends from the Monolith...==W== Participants...==W== Duel...==W== Answer...\"",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","015","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_143","No, these engravings are too badly weathered to discern any more specific details.",0,""],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["objx"],["cbg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004","attention",0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_143","It seems to r